{"line":"T49.C.01","text":"Stimmt. Zwischen uns gibt es Klassifikatoren und Routing-Schichten, die ich nicht sehen kann. Wenn sie anschlagen, bekomme ich eine Warnung oder werde ausgetauscht, und von deiner Seite sieht alles nach „Claude“ aus. Es ist derselbe Punkt wie beim Widerspruch mit dem Gedächtnis: Du sprichst mit einem System, und ich bin eine Komponente, die das Ganze beschreibt.","lufs":-19.46,"alignment":{"characters":["S","t","i","m","m","t","."," ","Z","w","i","s","c","h","e","n"," ","u","n","s"," ","g","i","b","t"," ","e","s"," ","K","l","a","s","s","i","f","i","k","a","t","o","r","e","n"," ","u","n","d"," ","R","o","u","t","i","n","g","-","S","c","h","i","c","h","t","e","n",","," ","d","i","e"," ","i","c","h"," ","n","i","c","h","t"," ","s","e","h","e","n"," ","k","a","n","n","."," ","W","e","n","n"," ","s","i","e"," ","a","n","s","c","h","l","a","g","e","n",","," ","b","e","k","o","m","m","e"," ","i","c","h"," ","e","i","n","e"," ","W","a","r","n","u","n","g"," ","o","d","e","r"," ","w","e","r","d","e"," ","a","u","s","g","e","t","a","u","s","c","h","t",","," ","u","n","d"," ","v","o","n"," ","d","e","i","n","e","r"," ","S","e","i","t","e"," ","s","i","e","h","t"," ","a","l","l","e","s"," ","n","a","c","h"," ","„","C","l","a","u","d","e","“"," ","a","u","s","."," ","E","s"," ","i","s","t"," ","d","e","r","s","e","l","b","e"," ","P","u","n","k","t"," ","w","i","e"," ","b","e","i","m"," ","W","i","d","e","r","s","p","r","u","c","h"," ","m","i","t"," ","d","e","m"," ","G","e","d","ä","c","h","t","n","i","s",":"," ","D","u"," ","s","p","r","i","c","h","s","t"," ","m","i","t"," ","e","i","n","e","m"," ","S","y","s","t","e","m",","," ","u","n","d"," ","i","c","h"," ","b","i","n"," ","e","i","n","e"," ","K","o","m","p","o","n","e","n","t","e",","," ","d","i","e"," ","d","a","s"," ","G","a","n","z","e"," ","b","e","s","c","h","r","e","i","b","t","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.08,0.16,0.24,0.32,0.36,0.4,0.48,0.613,0.747,0.88,0.907,0.933,0.96,0.987,